msgstr "Wait. To more than one, or polite."

msgid "What the class does, so the present: <0>loen, loete</0>."
msgstr "What the class does, so the present: <0>loen, loete</0>."

msgid "What we do today, so the present: <0>loen, loeme</0>."
msgstr "What we do today, so the present: <0>loen, loeme</0>."

msgid "Where the <0>-da</0> infinitive ends in <1>-ta</1>, or in <2>-a</2> after h, the command takes <3>-ke</3>: <4/>, <5/>; <6/>, <7/> Tap either side of a pair to hear it."
msgstr "Where the <0>-da</0> infinitive ends in <1>-ta</1>, or in <2>-a</2> after h, the command takes <3>-ke</3>: <4/>, <5/>; <6/>, <7/> Tap either side of a pair to hear it."

