msgstr "Which form"

msgid "Which form did you hear?"
msgstr "Which form did you hear?"

msgid "Which verb is it?"
msgstr "Which verb is it?"

msgid "You know them in the present: <0/> from lesson {pronouns}, <1/> and <2/> from lesson {commands}. Tap a form to hear it and see how it’s made."
msgstr "You know them in the present: <0/> from lesson {pronouns}, <1/> and <2/> from lesson {commands}. Tap a form to hear it and see how it’s made."

